      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use table.remove because Unnecessary table copying.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a list that is a copy of <b>src</b> but with the slice from <b>start</b> to <b>end</b> removed.</p>
</p>
